- Now grabs players upon contact and deals damage as long as they are being grabbed.
- Players can break free from grab by struggling.

Blazing Cage
- New Ability that replaces Spider Skull Summon
- Spawn a ring of fire in a large area around you, players who touch the flames will take massive damage.

Spider Skull Passive
- Killing a player with a LMB attack will transform them into a Spider Skull after a few seconds.
- A player that is converted will play as the Spider Skull and must attack players or else they will despawn.
- Hitting a player as a Spider Skull will increase their lifetime.</string><string name="Text">Scorching Grip
- Now grabs players upon contact and deals damage as long as they are being grabbed.
- Players can break free from grab by struggling.

Blazing Cage
- New Ability that replaces Spider Skull Summon
- Spawn a ring of fire in a large area around you, players who touch the flames will take massive damage.

Spider Skull Passive
- Killing a player with a LMB attack will transform them into a Spider Skull after a few seconds.
- A player that is converted will play as the Spider Skull and must attack players or else they will despawn.
- Hitting a player as a Spider Skull will increase their lifetime.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><token name="TextDirection">1</token><float name="TextSize">25</float><Color3 name="TextStrokeColor3"><R>0</R><G>0.011764707</G><B>0</B></Color3><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextXAlignment">0</token><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><bool name="Active">true</bool><token name="AutomaticSize">2</token><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0.105882362</R><G>0.164705887</G><B>0.207843155</B></Color3><token name="GuiState">3</token><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>1</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">MonsterLogText</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="ImageButton" referent="RBX7426"><Properties><Content name="Image"><url>rbxassetid://118147445442164</url></Content><Content name="ImageContent"><url>rbxassetid://118147445442164</url></Content><token name="ScaleType">3</token><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>0.305882365</R><G>0.34117648</G><B>0.400000006</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">10</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><token name="BorderMode">2</token><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><int name="LayoutOrder">1</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.0500000007</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.150000006</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0</XS><XO>125</XO><YS>0</YS><YO>125</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">-1</int><string name="Name">MonsterImage</string></Properties><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX7427"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizationMatchIdentifier">51ee782c-34aa-4121-8471-d0705b