Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">**Patch**

**NULWAYS**
- New map that also has an entire skin set dedicated to it!
- Every monster has received a &quot;Remembered&quot; skin.

**General**
- Fixed a few bugs.
- Updated some in-game ui.
- Added setting to disable warning screens when joining.
- Fixed Tamalanki not targetting players with 70% or less happiness on their pal percy toy.
- Tweaked hitboxes a small bit to hopefully feel less jank.</string><string name="Text">**Patch**

**NULWAYS**
- New map that also has an entire skin set dedicated to it!
- Every monster has received a &quot;Remembered&quot; skin.

**General**
- Fixed a few bugs.
- Updated some in-game ui.
- Added setting to disable warning screens when joining.
- Fixed Tamalanki not targetting players with 70% or less happiness on their pal percy toy.
- Tweaked hitboxes a small bit to hopefully feel less jank.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.054901965</R><G>0.905882418</G><B>1</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">25</float><Color3 name="TextStrokeColor3"><R>0</R><G>0.011764707</G><B>0</B></Color3><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextXAlignment">0</token><bool name="Active">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><token name="AutomaticSize">2</token><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0.105882362</R><G>0.164705887</G><B>0.207843155</B></Color3><int name="LayoutOrder">-99</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.5</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>-0.0700000003</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>1</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>2.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">PatchTXT</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX7466"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Italic</Style></Font><string name="LocalizationMatchIdentifier">88cbad49-d7e1-453e-b03a-5a337e7f6e05</string><string name="LocalizationMatchedSourceText">Patch Notes</string><string name="LocalizedText">Patch Notes</string><string name="Text">Patch Notes</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.835294127</R><G>0.776470602</G><B>0.745098054</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">30</float><Color3 name="TextStrokeColor3"><R>0.458823562</R><G>0.423529446</G><B>0.407843173</B></Color3><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.5</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><bool name="Active">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0.1058