"LocalizedText">★★★</string><string name="Text">★★★</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>0.741176486</G><B>0.290196091</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.75</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.278904349</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.83409673</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><float name="Rotation">0.5</float><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.417938292</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.0747390687</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">55</int><string name="Name">Stars</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX13472"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.776816607 1 1 1 0 0.870242238 0.490196079 0.490196079 0.490196079 0 1 0.247058824 0.247058824 0.247058824 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX13473"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Thought to be a myth by humans, the Fogborn is a creature that exists in the modern day as the last of its kind. It resides in large bodies of water, staying deep within to avoid any unwanted interactions.

The Fogborn&apos;s food source is that which it avoids: humans. It will emerge during foggy and stormy weather, using its inhuman abilities to paralyze and consume its prey.

It is best not to dwell near large bodies of water during foggy or stormy weather. 

The whistling may begin to draw near.</string><string name="Text">Thought to be a myth by humans, the Fogborn is a creature that exists in the modern day as the last of its kind. It resides in large bodies of water, staying deep within to avoid any unwanted interactions.

The Fogborn&apos;s food source is that which it avoids: humans. It will emerge during foggy and stormy weather, using its inhuman abilities to paralyze and consume its prey.

It is best not to dwell near large bodies of water during foggy or stormy weather. 

The whistling may begin to draw near.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.23137255</R><G>0.215686277</G><B>0.188235298</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><Color3 name="TextStrokeColor3"><R>0.549019635</R><G>0.466666669</G><B>0.337254912</B></Color3><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.949999988</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.720625341</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.479152769</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><float name="Rotation">-1</float><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.409380138</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.847833157</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">55</int><string name="Name">Desc</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX13474"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.961937726 1 1 1 0 0.984429121 0.490196079 0.490196079 0.490196079 0 1 0.247058824 0.247058824 0.247058824 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">-90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item></Item><Item class="ImageLabel" referent="RBX13475"><Properties><Content name="Image"><url>rbxassetid://75703530985864</url></Content><Content name="ImageContent"><url>rbxassetid://75703530985864</url></Content><token name="ResampleMode">1</token><token name="ScaleType">3</token><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.0820923746</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.162002981</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><float name="Rotation">0.5</float><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.407226086</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.555915713</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><bool name="Visible">false</bool><string name="Name">Rosemary</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX13476"><Properties><NumberSequence name="Transparency">0 0 0 0.753117204 0 0 1 1 0 </NumberSequence><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX13477"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">In life Rosemary was a sad and empty being with visions of having a normal life like others around her. Stricken with a disease that caused her to be locked away and looked down upon by other people, she over time grew bitter and hateful to the people that treated her so badly.

Her wants of a normal life started to grow into something different; she wanted those around her to suffer like she had. 

Once she started drifting into these thoughts, a voice would visit her. Telling her that these thoughts would set her free and give her a new life, she just had to agree to go through with it. She did, and now her fate has been sealed.

Rosemary is now a demonic soldier, a pawn for the demons above her to use as they see fit.</string><string name="Text">In life Rosemary was a sad and empty being with visions of having a normal life like others around her. Stricken with a disease that caused her to be locked away and looked down upon by other people, she over time grew bitter and hateful to the people that treated her so badly.

Her wants of a normal life started to grow into something different; she wanted those around her to suffer like she had. 

Once she started drifting into these thoughts, a voice would visit her. Telling her that these thoughts would set her free and give her a new life, she just had to agree to go through with it. She did, and now her fate has been sealed.

Rosemary is now a demonic soldier, a pawn for the demons above her to use as they see fit.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.720625341</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.479152769</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><float name="Rotation">-1</float><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.409380138</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.847833157</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">55</int><string name="Name">Desc</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX13478"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.961937726 1 1 1 0 0.984429121 0.490196079 0.490196079 0.490196079 0 1 0.247058824 0.247058824 0.247058824 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">-90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX13479"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">★★★</string><string name="Text">★★★</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>0.70588237</G><B>0.117647067</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePix