 a mansion on the outskirts of a small town; it is unknown who owns this mansion and when it was built.
Ao Oni seems to guard the mansion that it stays in, killing any living being that enters its walls. It also is known to infect its victims after killing them, transforming them into another Oni that will roam the mansion as well.
The reasons Ao Oni stays in and guards this mansion are not clear, but it doesn&apos;t seem keen on leaving it anytime soon.</string><string name="Text">The Ao Oni is a large bipedal blue demon of unknown origin. It currently resides in a mansion on the outskirts of a small town; it is unknown who owns this mansion and when it was built.
Ao Oni seems to guard the mansion that it stays in, killing any living being that enters its walls. It also is known to infect its victims after killing them, transforming them into another Oni that will roam the mansion as well.
The reasons Ao Oni stays in and guards this mansion are not clear, but it doesn&apos;t seem keen on leaving it anytime soon.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.720625341</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.479152769</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><float name="Rotation">-1</float><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.409380138</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.847833157</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">55</int><string name="Name">Desc</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX13490"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.961937726 1 1 1 0 0.984429121 0.490196079 0.490196079 0.490196079 0 1 0.247058824 0.247058824 0.247058824 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">-90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX13491"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">★★★</string><string name="Text">★★★</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>0.70588237</G><B>0.117647067</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B