ather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Pal Percy toys were the golden staple of Paltronics, the company responsible for producing and distributing them. 
Though, a flaw in their design whilst utilizing Paltronics’ staple “ever-lasting” batteries caused all of the toys to be immediately recalled - all except for one: the display model. 
Unlike its friends, it never got to experience play like they did... 

But after being left behind in the panic, and found again by an ex-employee of Percy’s Playhouse, its gained a new purpose of ensuring everyone, no matter what, stays his friend forever.</string><string name="Text">Pal Percy toys were the golden staple of Paltronics, the company responsible for producing and distributing them. 
Though, a flaw in their design whilst utilizing Paltronics’ staple “ever-lasting” batteries caused all of the toys to be immediately recalled - all except for one: the display model. 
Unlike its friends, it never got to experience play like they did... 

But after being left behind in the panic, and found again by an ex-employee of Percy’s Playhouse, its gained a new purpose of ensuring everyone, no matter what, stays his friend forever.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.23137255</R><G>0.215686277</G><B>0.188235298</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><Color3 name="TextStrokeColor3"><R>0.549019635</R><G>0.466666669</G><B>0.337254912</B></Color3><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.949999988</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.720625341</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.479152769</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><float name="Rotation">-1</float><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.409380138</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.847833157</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">55</int><string name="Name">Desc</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX13504"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.961937726 1 1 1 0 0.984429121 0.490196079 0.490196079 0.490196079 0 1 0.247058824 0.247058824 0.247058824 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">-90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX13505"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Kalam.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">His most beautiful creation... Valem is one of the first high-class demons to have ever been spawned. 

He is a deceptive trickster who will manipulate humans into trusting him and doing things for him, only to take their souls as well as many others.

He, as a demon, believes that the world belongs to the demons and not the humans that reside there. 

He will do anything necessary to gain more power and rid the world of humanity.</string><string name="Text">His most beautiful creation... Valem is one of the first high-class demons to have ever been spawned. 

He is a deceptive trickster who will manipulate humans into trusting him and doing things for him, only to take their souls as well as many others.

He, as a demon, believes that the world belongs to the demons and not the humans that reside there. 

He will do anything necessary to gain more power and rid the world of humanity.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.254901975</R><G>0.203921586</G><B>0.160784319</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><Color3 name="TextStrokeColor3"><R>0.549019635</R><G>0.466666669</G><B>0.337254912</B></Color3><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextXAlignment">0</token><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.725000024</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.479000002</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><float name="Rotation">-1</float><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.409380138</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.847833157</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><int name="ZIndex">55</int><string name="Name">Desc</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX13506"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.961937726 1 1 1 0 0.984429121 0.490196079 0.490196079 0.490196079 0 1 0.247058824 0.247058824 0.247058824 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">-90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="ImageButton" referent="RBX13507"><Properties><Content name="Image"><url>rbxassetid://38833857</url></Content><Color3 name="ImageColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><Content name="ImageContent"><url>rbxassetid://38833857</url></Content><float name="ImageTransparency">0.200000003</float><token name="ScaleType">3</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><UDim2