t><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.5</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.980000019</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.980000019</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">Settings</string></Properties><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX14131"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Balthazar.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">- FOLLOW ROBLOX TOS.

- Don&apos;t impersonate staff/developers of the game.

- Don&apos;t constantly team with other players and make the game unfair.

- Don&apos;t alt farm/use other accounts to get easy XP/Coins.

- No AFK Farming/Macroing.

- No using Shaders/FX plugins that mess with the games lighting.

- Don&apos;t use extremely offensive avatars that break ROBLOX TOS.

- Don&apos;t exploit/hack obviously.

- ANY OF THESE OFFENSES CAN RESULT IN A TEMPORARY OR PERMANENT BAN.</string><string name="Text">- FOLLOW ROBLOX TOS.

- Don&apos;t impersonate staff/developers of the game.

- Don&apos;t constantly team with other players and make the game unfair.

- Don&apos;t alt farm/use other accounts to get easy XP/Coins.

- No AFK Farming/Macroing.

- No using Shaders/FX plugins that mess with the games lighting.

- Don&apos;t use extremely offensive avatars that break ROBLOX TOS.

