ntFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Agatha can use &quot;Telekinesis&quot; on players inflicted with &quot;Telekinesis Debuff&quot;. 

Pressing the interact key on them allows you to use &quot;Telekinesis&quot;.

Agatha can PUSH players into walls to cause extra damage, or she can PULL them close to her.

Telekinesis push/pull can be blocked or dodged.</string><string name="Text">Agatha can use &quot;Telekinesis&quot; on players inflicted with &quot;Telekinesis Debuff&quot;. 

Pressing the interact key on them allows you to use &quot;Telekinesis&quot;.

Agatha can PUSH players into walls to cause extra damage, or she can PULL them close to her.

Telekinesis push/pull can be blocked or dodged.</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.917647123</R><G>0.917647123</G><B>0.917647123</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">15</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.5</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><token name="TextXAlignment">0</token><token name="TextYAlignment">0</token><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0</Y></Vector2><token name="AutomaticSize">2</token><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.524999976</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.300000012</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.850000024</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.601000011</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">MoveTXT</string></Properties><Item class="UITextSizeConstraint" referent="RBX15404"><Properties><int name="MaxTextSize">25</int><string name="Name">UITextSizeConstraint</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX15405"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Telekinesis</string><string name="Text">Telekinesis</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><float name="TextSize">25</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.5</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.5</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.1669999