olor3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><int name="LayoutOrder">9</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.0851477459</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.237815127</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>1.5</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.0900000036</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">Survivor Gameplay</string></Properties><Item class="UIScale" referent="RBX16681"><Properties><string name="Name">UIScale</string></Properties></Item><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16682"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 0.588235319 0.588235319 0.588235319 0 0.25 1 1 1 0 0.75 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16683"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Survivor Gameplay</string><string name="Text">Survivor Gameplay</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.619607866</R><G>0.898039281</G><B>1</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.850000024</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.513000011</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.823862314</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">TXT</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16684"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.384083062 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16685"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">**------- Survivor Gameplay Loop -------**

Survivors must do tasks while avoiding the monster; completing a team task will reduce the round timer.

Every survivor has their own set of client tasks; no one else can do these but that survivor.

Survivors can equip themselves with classes to fight back against the monster or to support their teammates.

Once the timer has run out, the escape sequence will start. Survivors must reach the escape before it closes.

**------- Tips to help you survive -------**

Conserve your stamina and only sprint when you know the monster is nearby; keep your ears open for monster sound cues.

Juking monster attacks is a good strategy; try running around the monster when they attack to confuse them and make them miss.

Look at each monster&apos;s moveset information and learn how they work; doing this will make them much easier to survive and avoid.

**------- Ways to get QUEUE POINTS -------**

- Doing tasks
- Hitting the monster with abilities
- Getting chased by the monster
- Supporting other survivors with abilities and items
- Escaping</string><string name="Text">**------- Survivor Gameplay Loop -------**

Survivors must do tasks while avoiding the monster; completing a team task will reduce the round timer.

Every survivor has their own set of client tasks; no one else can do these but that survivor.

Survivors can equip themselves with classes to fight back against the monster or to support their teammates.

Once the timer has run out, the escape sequence will start. Survivors must reach the escape before it closes.

**------- Tips to help you survive -------**

Conserve your stamina and only sprint when you know the monster is nearby; keep your ears open for monster sound cues.

Juking monster attacks is a good strategy; try running around the monster when they attack to confuse them and make them miss.

Look at each monster&apos;s moveset information and learn how they work; doing this will make them much easier to survive and avoid.

**------- Ways to get QUEUE POINTS -------**

- Doing tasks
- Hitting the monster with abilities
- Getting chased by the monster
- Supporting other survivors with abilities and items
- Escaping</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.619607866</R><G>0.898039281</G><B>1</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.850000024</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.513000011</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.823862314</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><bool name="Visible">false</bool><string name="Name">DESC</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="ImageButton" referent="RBX16686"><Properties><Content name="Image"><url>rbxassetid://18963081613</url></Content><Content name="ImageContent"><url>rbxassetid://18963081613</url></Content><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><int name="LayoutOrder">9</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.0851477459</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.237815127</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>1.5</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.0900000036</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">Monster Gameplay</string></Properties><Item class="UIScale" referent="RBX16687"><Properties><string name="Name">UIScale</string></Properties></Item><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16688"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 0.588235319 0.588235319 0.588235319 0 0.25 1 1 1 0 0.75 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16689"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Monster Gameplay</string><string name="Text">Monster Gameplay</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>0.490196079</G><B>0.490196079</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.850000024</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.513000011</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.823862314</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">TXT</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16690"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.384083062 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16691"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">**------- Monster Gameplay Loop -------**

Monsters must kill the survivors and stop them from escaping. Getting a kill will increase the round timer.

Monsters have abilities and monster-only areas they can utilize to help them secure kills on the survivors.

**------- Tips to help you as a monster -------**

Entering a monster-only area will increase your speed and highlight all players on the map.

Killing a player will highlight all players on the map for a few seconds.

When starting a chase, make sure you have max stamina. Monsters are usually slower than survivors or have less max stamina.

Read your monsters moveset information and try them out in the practice area to get familiar with them.

**------- Ways to get QUEUE POINTS -------**

- Killing a player
- Players leaving</string><string name="Text">**------- Monster Gameplay Loop -------**

Monsters must kill the survivors and stop them from escaping. Getting a kill will increase the round timer.

Monsters have abilities and monster-only areas they can utilize to help them secure kills on the survivors.

**------- Tips to help you as a monster -------**

Entering a monster-only area will increase your speed and highlight all players on the map.

Killing a player will highlight all players on the map for a few seconds.

When starting a chase, make sure you have max stamina. Monsters are usually slower than survivors or have less max stamina.

Read your monsters moveset information and try them out in the practice area to get familiar with them.

**------- Ways to get QUEUE POINTS -------**

- Killing a player
- Players leaving</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.619607866</R><G>0.898039281</G><B>1</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.850000024</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.513000011</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.823862314</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><bool name="Visible">false</bool><string name="Name">DESC</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="ImageButton" referent="RBX16692"><Properties><Content name="Image"><url>rbxassetid://18963081613</url></Content><Content name="ImageContent"><url>rbxassetid://18963081613</url></Content><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><int name="LayoutOrder">9</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.0851477459</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.237815127</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>1.5</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.0900000036</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">Queue Points</string></Properties><Item class="UIScale" referent="RBX16693"><Properties><string name="Name">UIScale</string></Properties></Item><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16694"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 0.588235319 0.588235319 0.588235319 0 0.25 1 1 1 0 0.75 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16695"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Queue Points</string><string name="Text">Queue Points</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>1</R><G>0.113725498</G><B>0.113725498</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.850000024</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.513000011</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.823862314</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">TXT</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16696"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.384083062 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16697"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">**------- What are Queue Points (QP)? -------**

Queue Points (QP) are points that players get every round; the player with the most Queue Points will become the monster.

Queue Points can be found on the player list. It is shown as a red skull icon with a number on top of it.

**------- Mercy Feature -------**

If you gain less than 5 QP during a round, you will be given +5 QP as compensation.

Players with low amounts of playtime will be given +3 extra QP every round.

**------- Ways to get queue points? -------**

- Every round players get 1 QP.
- Being chased by the monster
- Helping survivors with abilities or items
- Hitting monsters with abilities
- Doing tasks as survivor
- Killing players as the monster
- Players leaving the round when you are the monster
- Purchasing QP via the shop</string><string name="Text">**------- What are Queue Points (QP)? -------**

Queue Points (QP) are points that players get every round; the player with the most Queue Points will become the monster.

Queue Points can be found on the player list. It is shown as a red skull icon with a number on top of it.

**------- Mercy Feature -------**

If you gain less than 5 QP during a round, you will be given +5 QP as compensation.

Players with low amounts of playtime will be given +3 extra QP every round.

**------- Ways to get queue points? -------**

- Every round players get 1 QP.
- Being chased by the monster
- Helping survivors with abilities or items
- Hitting monsters with abilities
- Doing tasks as survivor
- Killing players as the monster
- Players leaving the round when you are the monster
- Purchasing QP via the shop</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.619607866</R><G>0.898039281</G><B>1</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.850000024</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.513000011</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.823862314</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><bool name="Visible">false</bool><string name="Name">DESC</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="ImageButton" referent="RBX16698"><Properties><Content name="Image"><url>rbxassetid://18963081613</url></Content><Content name="ImageContent"><url>rbxassetid://18963081613</url></Content><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><int name="LayoutOrder">9</int><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.0851477459</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.237815127</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>1.5</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.0900000036</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">Practice Area</string></Properties><Item class="UIScale" referent="RBX16699"><Properties><string name="Name">UIScale</string></Properties></Item><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16700"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 0.588235319 0.588235319 0.588235319 0 0.25 1 1 1 0 0.75 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16701"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">Practice Area</string><string name="Text">Practice Area</string><Color3 name="TextColor3"><R>0.46274513</R><G>1</G><B>0.368627459</B></Color3><bool name="TextScaled">true</bool><float name="TextSize">14</float><float name="TextStrokeTransparency">0.850000024</float><bool name="TextWrapped">true</bool><Vector2 name="AnchorPoint"><X>0.5</X><Y>0.5</Y></Vector2><Color3 name="BackgroundColor3"><R>1</R><G>1</G><B>1</B></Color3><float name="BackgroundTransparency">1</float><Color3 name="BorderColor3"><R>0</R><G>0</G><B>0</B></Color3><int name="BorderSizePixel">0</int><token name="GuiState">3</token><bool name="Interactable">false</bool><UDim2 name="Position"><XS>0.513000011</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><UDim2 name="Size"><XS>0.823862314</XS><XO>0</XO><YS>0.5</YS><YO>0</YO></UDim2><string name="Name">TXT</string></Properties><Item class="UIGradient" referent="RBX16702"><Properties><ColorSequence name="Color">0 1 1 1 0 0.384083062 1 1 1 0 1 0.384313732 0.384313732 0.384313732 0 </ColorSequence><float name="Rotation">90</float><string name="Name">UIGradient</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="TextLabel" referent="RBX16703"><Properties><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url>rbxasset://fonts/families/Merriweather.json</url></Family><Weight>700</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><string name="LocalizedText">**------- What is the practice area? -------**

You can practice any monster or class for free by clicking on the information button when you view them on the inventory screen.

Once you click on practice, you will be teleported to a blank map in which you can test out the class or monster without any other players present.

To return to the lobby, you can talk to &quot;Mr Pinky&quot; and press return to lobby.







</string><string name="Text">**------- What is the practice area? -------**

You can practice any monster or class for free by clicking on the information button when you view them on the inventory screen.

Once you click on practice, you will be teleported to a blank map in which you can test out the class or monster without any other players present.

To return to the lobby, you can talk to &quot;Mr Pinky&quot; and press return to lobby.







